=2 Walkthrough
* Defeat all 6 known subspecies of caturae.
* Obtaining the title associated with each NM is necessary to advance.
** It is possible to defeat any or all caturae before the start of this quest.
** Note: If you have done this, you may check if you have the titles by talking with the bard npc {n:Zuah Lepahnyu} in Port Jeuno (J-8). You do not need to set each title to continue.

* The titles necessary are:
** Iratham Capturer: {m:Iratham} in {z:Abyssea - Tahrongi}.
** Kutharei Unhorser: {m:Kutharei} in {z:Abyssea - Misareaux}.
** Sippoy Capturer: {m:Sippoy} in {z:Abyssea - Vunkerl}.
** Yaanei Crasher: {m:Yaanei} in {z:Abyssea - Attohwa}.
** Rani Decrowner: {m:Rani} in {z:Abyssea - Altepa}.
** Raja Regicide: {m:Raja} in {z:Abyssea - Grauberg}.

* Talk to Joachim after killing all 6 Abyssea Caturae for a cutscene and receive the {k:Abyssite of discernment}.

* Enter the {z:Hall of the Gods} between 18:00 - and 5:00 for a cutscene.
** The next mission {q:Beneath a Blood-red Sky|Beneath a Blood-red Sky|Beneath a Blood-red Sky} starts after the end of the cutscene..

